    202.4,
    305.6,
    269.4
   ],
   "bbox_rel": [
    0.09731,
    0.25823,
    0.49104,
    0.34365
   ],
   "text": "abranchial: without branchiae. abyssal: oceanic waters between depths of 4000 m and 6000 m. achaetous: without chaetae. acicula, aciculae: stout supportive chaeta found internally in projecting parapodial rami.",
   "italic_words": [],
   "col": 0,
   "order": 3,
   "bbox_scan_rel": [
    0.03712,
    0.25166,
    0.45198,
    0.34005
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "p0339-b04",
   "role": "entry",
   "level": null,
   "bbox_pt": [
    60.6,
    274.4,
    305.7,
    323.4
   ],
   "bbox_rel": [
    0.09731,
    0.35001,
    0.49106,
    0.4125
   ],
   "text": "acicular chaeta: stout, projecting chaeta. acrosome: membrane limited organelle at apex of spermatozoon head, covering the anterior surface of the nucleus; secretes enzymes thought to facilitate sperm entry.",
   "italic_words": [],
   "col": 0,
   "order": 4,
   "bbox_scan_rel": [
    0.03607,
    0.34231,
    0.45062,
    0.40805
   ]
  },
  {
