    355.4,
    305.7,
    392.3
   ],
   "bbox_rel": [
    0.09731,
    0.45329,
    0.49106,
    0.50047
   ],
   "text": "aileron: accessory jaw plate in *Glyceridae*. aliform: elongate narrow lobe, used to refer to a pair of notopodia of some *Chaetopteridae*.",
   "italic_words": [
    "Glyceridae",
    "Chaetopteridae"
   ],
