    0.67897,
    0.49106,
    0.75677
   ],
   "text": "antennular auricle: see auricule. anterior cirri: dorsal and/or ventral cirri of parapodia of cephalized segments; often more elongate than those of more posterior parapodia; confused in the literature with peristomial cirri. (See tentacular cirri).",
